  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかふかの　たいもうで　さむさに\nつよくなり　さらに　こうおんの\nほのおわざを　だせるようになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "푹신푹신한 털 덕분에 추위에\n강해지고 더 높은 온도의\n불꽃 기술도 쓸 수 있게 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蓬鬆的體毛幫助牠增強了抵禦\n寒冷的能力，也使牠能夠使出\n溫度更高的火屬性招式。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son pelage épais lui permet de mieux résister\nau froid et d’augmenter la température\nde ses capacités Feu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein flauschiges Fell schützt es vor Kälte und\nermöglicht es ihm, noch heißere Feuer-Attacken\nauszuteilen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su suave pelaje lo protege del frío y le permite\nincrementar todavía más la temperatura de sus\nmovimientos de tipo Fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grazie alla folta pelliccia resiste al freddo\ned è in grado di sferrare mosse infuocate\na temperature ancora più alte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its thick and fluffy fur protects it from the cold\nand enables it to use hotter fire moves.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかふかの　体毛で　寒さに\n強くなり　さらに　高温の\n炎技を　出せるようになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蓬松的体毛帮助它增强了抵御\n寒冷的能力，也使它能够使出\n温度更高的火属性招式。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su suave pelaje lo protege del frío y le permite\nincrementar todavía más la temperatura de sus\nmovimientos de tipo Fuego.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てを　つかわずに　きの　えだから\nきのみを　つみとり　リフティング。\nあしわざを　みがく　れんしゅう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손을 쓰지 않고 나뭇가지에서\n나무열매를 따내고 리프팅한다.\n발 기술을 연마하는 연습이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用腳把樹果從樹木上\n踢落，用來練習挑球，\n藉此鍛鍊自己的腳法。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pour parfaire son jeu de jambes,\nil cueille des Baies puis drible avec,\nle tout sans se servir de ses mains.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es pflückt Beeren von Ästen, ohne seine Hände\nzu benutzen, und jongliert sie mit den Füßen.\nDamit trainiert es seine Fußfertigkeiten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mejorar su habilidad con los pies, toma\nbayas de las ramas de los árboles sin usar las\nmanos y juega a darles toques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Per perfezionare i suoi calci, si esercita\nprendendo le bacche dai rami degli alberi\ne palleggiando senza usare le mani.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It kicks berries right off the branches of trees\nand then juggles them with its feet, practicing\nits footwork.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手を　使わずに　木の　枝から\n木の実を　摘み取り　リフティング。\n足技を　磨く　練習。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用脚把树果从树木上\n踢落，用来练习颠球，\n借此锻炼自己的脚法。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mejorar su habilidad con los pies, toma\nbayas de las ramas de los árboles sin usar las\nmanos y juega a darles toques.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかふかの　たいもうの　おかげでほのおエネルギーを　あたためやすくさらに　つよい　ほのおを　だせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "푹신푹신한 털 덕분에 불꽃 에너지의 온도를 올리기 쉬워져서 더욱 강한 불꽃을 내보낼 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蓬鬆的體毛幫助牠更容易提升火之能量的溫度，釋放出更強的火焰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son pelage doux et épais lui permet de mobiliser facilement son énergie incandescente, et ainsi de produire des flammes encore plus puissantes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dank seines flauschigen Fells kann es leichter Feuer-Energie aufbauen und dadurch noch heißere Flammen ausstoßen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su suave pelaje le permite calentar energía ígnea con mayor facilidad y así expulsar llamas todavía más potentes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grazie alla folta pelliccia, riesce a scaldare facilmente l’energia Fuoco e quindi a sprigionare fiamme ancora più potenti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Thanks to its soft and fluffy fur, Raboot can easily heat up its fire energy and produce flames with more power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふかふかの　体毛の　おかげで炎エネルギーを　温めやすくさらに　強い　炎を　出せる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
