    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たさいな　キックわざが　じまんだがほのおで　あつくなった　ひたいでくりだす　ずつきも　きょうりょく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다채로운 킥 기술을 자랑하지만 불꽃에 의해 뜨거워진 이마로 부딪치는 박치기도 상당히 강력하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以自己多彩多姿的踢技為傲，但利用因火焰而變熱的額頭使出的頭錘也十分強勁。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa maîtrise des différents types de coups de pied fait sa fierté, mais les coups de tête qu’il assène quand son front est brûlant sont aussi ravageurs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vielfältige Tritt-Attacken sind sein ganzer Stolz, aber ein Stoß mit seiner Stirn, die durch sein Feuer erhitzt wurde, hat es ebenfalls in sich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se enorgullece de sus variadas técnicas con los pies, pero, cuando su frente se calienta por las llamas, también propina tremendos cabezazos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Va fiero del suo ricco repertorio di mosse basate sui calci, ma le testate che sferra con la fronte arroventata sono altrettanto temibili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "While it prides itself on its varied kicking moves, it can also deliver powerful headbutts once its flames have heated up its forehead.",
      "language": {
